                    <div id="Collapse-4abfa666adf72433fe2e" class=" show collapse" aria-labelledby="primaryHeading-0-ae4b16c" data-parent="#accordion-6adf72433fe2e">

                        <div class="elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content">
                            <p>We integrate intelligent water management systems, including rainwater harvesting and efficient plumbing solutions, to reduce wastage and preserve natural resources. Every drop is valued because responsible development begins with mindful conservation.</p>                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->

                
                <div class="elementskit-card ">
                    <div class="elementskit-card-header" id="primaryHeading-1-ae4b16c">
                        <a href="#collapse-c3fb7636adf72433fe2e" class="ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed" data-ekit-toggle="collapse" data-target="#Collapse-c3fb7636adf72433fe2e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="Collapse-c3fb7636adf72433fe2e">
                            
                                <span class="number"></span>

                            
                            <span class="ekit-accordion-title">Energy Saving</span>

                            
                                <div class="ekit_accordion_icon_group">
                                    <div class="ekit_accordion_normal_icon">
                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->
										<i class="icon icon-plus"></i>                                    </div>

                                    <div class="ekit_accordion_active_icon">
                                        <!-- Active Icon -->
										<i class="icon icon-minus"></i>                                    </div>
                                </div>

                            
                                                    </a>
                    </div>

                    <div id="Collapse-c3fb7636adf72433fe2e" class=" collapse" aria-labelledby="primaryHeading-1-ae4b16c" data-parent="#accordion-6adf72433fe2e">

                        <div class="elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content">
                            <p>From energy-efficient design planning to solar-enabled amenities and optimized natural light and ventilation, our developments are built to lower consumption while enhancing comfort. Sustainable energy is not an add-on; it’s embedded in our thinking.</p>                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->

                
                <div class="elementskit-card ">
                    <div class="elementskit-card-header" id="primaryHeading-2-ae4b16c">
                        <a href="#collapse-323e0dd6adf72433fe2e" class="ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed" data-ekit-toggle="collapse" data-target="#Collapse-323e0dd6adf72433fe2e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="Collapse-323e0dd6adf72433fe2e">
                            
