                        <div class="elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content">
                            <p>Structured waste segregation and recycling systems are incorporated within our communities to ensure responsible disposal and reuse of resources. By promoting conscious habits, we create environments that are cleaner, greener, and future-ready.</p>                        </div>

